    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an intergalactic thief robs the arcane Power Crystals, it\u2019s up to Cardinal, Azura, Banana and Pistachio to work together as one being to save the day! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you run, jump, and slide your way through colorful levels, you\u2019ll have to combine each character\u2019s unique abilities to traverse the challenging terrain in your way! Clear wide pits by double jumping as Cardinal, then swap to Azura to dash across, or climb up a wall as Banana, then gracefully glide over the abyss as Pistachio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 distinct worlds chock-full of mystery and adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Responsive controls with room for skillful mastery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A wonderful and vibrant hand-drawn pixel-art aesthetic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hectic boss-fights against larger-than-life creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deep and fluid moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A charming cast of quirky characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An upbeat soundtrack composed by Christoph Jakob!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Assist Mode options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2026vehicles and guns?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Creativity!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the levels of your dreams using the <strong>Level Builder</strong>, and upload even your wildest creations to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>! There are hundreds of user-generated levels ready to download and play, so there's always something new waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If that\u2019s not enough, you can even create and share your own pets using the <strong>Pet Maker</strong> - they\u2019ll follow you around in levels and explore the world with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant Venture is currently in Early Access, delivering a nearly complete gameplay experience. As development progresses, some elements may evolve based on feedback and refinement. We\u2019re excited to have you along for the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an intergalactic thief robs the arcane Power Crystals, it\u2019s up to Cardinal, Azura, Banana and Pistachio to work together as one being to save the day! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/4e51a6517c27b8ce786507b114897c82.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you run, jump, and slide your way through colorful levels, you\u2019ll have to combine each character\u2019s unique abilities to traverse the challenging terrain in your way! Clear wide pits by double jumping as Cardinal, then swap to Azura to dash across, or climb up a wall as Banana, then gracefully glide over the abyss as Pistachio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/52d051cf9c9905967ed3aad3770eccd0.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 distinct worlds chock-full of mystery and adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Responsive controls with room for skillful mastery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A wonderful and vibrant hand-drawn pixel-art aesthetic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hectic boss-fights against larger-than-life creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deep and fluid moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A charming cast of quirky characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An upbeat soundtrack composed by Christoph Jakob!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Assist Mode options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2026vehicles and guns?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/0097b29249c2e2c03b7e487e326fd1bd.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Creativity!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the levels of your dreams using the <strong>Level Builder</strong>, and upload even your wildest creations to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>! There are hundreds of user-generated levels ready to download and play, so there's always something new waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/afa1149158ad1fd0b40515ee509fd633.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If that\u2019s not enough, you can even create and share your own pets using the <strong>Pet Maker</strong> - they\u2019ll follow you around in levels and explore the world with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.poster.avif?t=1741460298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.webm?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264520/extras/79f4d012a003434badd13db8b2edc32d.mp4?t=1741460298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibrant Venture is currently in Early Access, delivering a nearly complete gameplay experience. As development progresses, some elements may evolve based on feedback and refinement. We\u2019re excited to have you along for the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
